mal Cooperation Deal","src":"TVC News","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijAFBVV95cUxOaU1kSFB3ZEk3dnExMU5qWm56UFIzcVlBNzVGLWpZd25IZmRTZFpFbHJ5VEpnTkJleEc2VERfVmVaZmNYaTVSdElGdV8tNHlqdzZxNTRkUXF1bjJpc2pFRnU1anhlMnJydnRjQmUzc2szeDBlMU9sSUVfbk9xOUhBNDREZXdrV3lMcG1xXw?oc=5","date":"2026-10-21","zh":"西非經共體與薩赫勒集團同意就正式合作協議進行談判"},{"title":"AES and ECOWAS Reopen Talks: What a New Deal Could Change","src":"within nigeria","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-10-20","zh":"AES 和西非經共體重新開啟談判：新政可以改變什麼"},{"title":"West Africa: Ecowas, AES Move to Salvage Regional Trade, Security Ties","src":"allAfrica.com","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiW0FVX3lxTFBJaE5LSmtkUnZrT29fclhGenRlQWFtZkoxQmlwVDNRWDNQRWgzbmEyR0Yxa2YxWXFjc195Z2xnM2NhajhJYUg0dmREUjlqT0p1REUxTXhOejlkclE?oc=5","date":"2026-10-19","zh":"西非：西非經共體、AES 採取行動挽救區域貿易和安全關係"},{"title":"Nearly 21 months after leaving ECOWAS, breakaway Sahel states agree to negotiate new deal with West African bloc","src":"Business Insider Africa","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-10-18","zh":"離開西非經共體近 21 個月後，脫離薩赫爾國家同意與西非集團談判新協議"}],"themes":[{"name":"財報","count":4},{"name":"訂單/合約","count":4},{"name":"能源/電力","count":1},{"name":"併購","count":1},{"name":"分析師評等","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-03-02","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/874761/000087476126000063/aes-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Item 1.—Business is an outline of our strategy and our businesses by SBU, including key financial drivers. Additional items that may have an impact on our businesses are discussed in Item 1A.—Risk Factors and Item 3.—Legal Proceedings.","zh":null},{"en":"Incorporated in 1981, AES is a global energy company accelerating the future of energy. Together with our many stakeholders, we are improving lives by delivering the greener, smarter energy solutions the world needs. Our diverse workforce is committed to continuous innovation and operational excellence, while partnering with our customers on their strategic energy transitions and continuing to meet their energy needs today.","zh":null},{"en":"The focus of our strategy is to partner with large corporations to deliver the electricity they need when they need it. We are very well-positioned as a leading provider of renewable energy to data center companies, particularly in the U.S., and to large mining companies outside the U.S. These customers want to work with AES due to our track record of providing customized solutions that best serve their specific needs and delivering our projects on time and on budget.","zh":null}],"markets":[{"en":"The segment reporting structure uses the Company's management reporting structure as its foundation to reflect how the Company manages the businesses internally and is mainly organized by technology.","zh":null},{"en":"We are organized into four technology-oriented SBUs: Renewables (solar, wind, energy storage, and hydro generation facilities); Utilities (AES Indiana, AES Ohio, and AES El Salvador regulated utilities and their generation facilities); Energy Infrastructure (natural gas, LNG, coal, pet coke, diesel, and oil generation facilities); and New Energy Technologies (investments in Fluence, Maximo and other new and innovative energy technology businesses) — which are led by our SBU Presidents.","zh":null}],"customers":[{"en":"We sell to a wide variety of customers. No individual customer accounted for 10% or more of our 2025 total revenue. In our generation business, we own and/or operate power plants to sell power to wholesale customers such as utilities and other intermediaries, as well as to large corporations. Our utilities sell to end-user customers in the residential, commercial, industrial, and governmental sectors in a defined service area.","zh":null},{"en":"At AES, our people are instrumental to helping us meet the world's energy needs. Supporting our people is a foundational value for AES. Our actions are grounded in the shared values that shape AES' culture: Safety First, Highest Standards, and All Together. The AES Corporation is led and managed by our Chief Executive Officer and the Global Leadership Team with the guidance and oversight of our Board of Directors. Governance and standards for AES people are guided by the Chief Human Resources Officer, with input from members of the Global Leadership Team.","zh":null}],"competition":[],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Energy Infrastructure","val":5402000000,"zh":"Energy Infrastructure"},{"name":"Utilities","val":4122000000,"zh":"Utilities"},{"name":"Renewables","val":2913000000,"zh":"Renewables"},{"name":"AES Andes","val":900000000,"zh":"AES Andes"},{"name":"New Energy Technologies","val":1000000,"zh":"New Energy Technologies"}],"total":12233000000},"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Electricity Generation","val":8195000000,"zh":"Electricity Generation"},{"name":"Nonregulatedrevenue","val":8195000000,"zh":"Nonregulatedrevenue"},{"name":"Electric Distribution","val":4038000000,"zh":"Electric Distribution"},{"name":"Regulated Revenue","val":4038000000,"zh":"Regulated Revenue"}],"total":12233000000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Total Non Us","val":7177000000,"zh":"Total Non Us"},{"name":"US","val":5056000000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"CL","val":1516000000,"zh":"CL"},{"name":"DO","val":1363000000,"zh":"DO"},{"name":"SV","val":1086000000,"zh":"SV"},{"name":"MX","val":760000000,"zh":"墨西哥"},{"name":"BG","val":687000000,"zh":"BG"},{"name":"PA","val":649000000,"zh":"PA"},{"name":"CO","val":422000000,"zh":"CO"},{"name":"PR","val":404000000,"zh":"PR"}],"total":12233000000}},"peers":["EIX","CNP","CMS","ETR","AEP"]}}